<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZSE trading hours over holiday period.</title>
<headline>NZSE trading hours over holiday period.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Friday it will trade the following hours over the holiday period:</p>
<p>-- December 24 closes noon</p>
<p>-- December 25-26 closed</p>
<p>-- December 27, December 30 normal hours</p>
<p>-- December 31, closed noon</p>
<p>-- Jan 1, 2 closed</p>
<p>-- Jan 3 onwards, normal trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
